type: software
title: "shape-demographics: shape-only demographic prediction, attribution, and privacy analysis"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline that turns TotalSegmentator CT and MRI segmentations into
  surface point clouds and measures how much demographic and identifying information
  organ shape alone carries, with image intensity removed.
